"""gen36 → gen37：第 5 頁 install 泳道重排（分支往左欄）、verify 標題與比對框、便條高度"""
src = open("gen36.py").read()
def rep(old, new, count=1):
    global src
    assert src.count(old) == count, (src.count(old), old[:90])
    src = src.replace(old, new)
rep('p4.append(v("install", "1", SW(NEUTRAL), "install（核心：把 dist/ 放進 .<name>/）", 20, 60, 460, 1010))', 'p4.append(v("install", "1", SW(NEUTRAL), "install（核心：把 dist/ 放進 .<name>/）", 20, 60, 460, 1040))')
rep('p4.append(v("l0", "install", ELLIPSE(GREEN), "開始 install", 150, 50, 160, 50))', 'p4.append(v("l0", "install", ELLIPSE(GREEN), "開始 install", 250, 50, 160, 50))')
rep('"對專案目錄上鎖（排他）\\n拿不到：1 秒後印訊息，最多等 60 秒", 90, 130, 280, 50)', '"對專案目錄上鎖（排他）\\n拿不到：1 秒後印訊息，最多等 60 秒", 205, 130, 250, 50)')
rep('p4.append(v("l1q", "install", RHOMBUS, "拿到鎖？", 140, 210, 180, 80))', 'p4.append(v("l1q", "install", RHOMBUS, "拿到鎖？", 240, 210, 180, 80))')
rep('"逾時或鎖不支援：\\n中止，不動任何檔", 15, 325, 190, 60)', '"逾時或鎖不支援：\\n中止，不動任何檔", 15, 330, 190, 60)')
rep('p4.append(v("l2", "install", LEAF(), "重讀版本檔與印記第一行", 130, 330, 200, 40))', 'p4.append(v("l2", "install", LEAF(), "重讀版本檔與印記第一行", 230, 330, 200, 40))')
rep('p4.append(v("l3", "install", RHOMBUS, "印記已是\\n目標版本？", 140, 400, 180, 80))', 'p4.append(v("l3", "install", RHOMBUS, "印記已是\\n目標版本？", 240, 400, 180, 80))')
rep('p4.append(v("l4", "install", LEAF(), "清掉殘留的 .<name>.tmp.*", 130, 520, 200, 40))', 'p4.append(v("l4", "install", LEAF(), "清掉殘留的 .<name>.tmp.*", 230, 520, 200, 40))')
rep('p4.append(v("l5", "install", LEAF(), "複製 dist/ 到亂數名暫存目錄", 130, 590, 200, 40))', 'p4.append(v("l5", "install", LEAF(), "複製 dist/ 到亂數名暫存目錄", 230, 590, 200, 40))')
rep('"寫印記（--self 的版本＋每檔指紋）", 130, 660, 200, 40)', '"寫印記（--self 的版本＋每檔指紋）", 230, 660, 200, 40)')
rep('"刪舊 .<name>/、暫存目錄改名\\n（整批覆蓋；空窗由鎖遮住）", 130, 730, 200, 60)', '"刪舊 .<name>/、暫存目錄改名\\n（整批覆蓋；空窗由鎖遮住）", 230, 730, 200, 60)')
rep('p4.append(v("l8", "install", LEAF(), "釋放鎖", 130, 820, 200, 40))', 'p4.append(v("l8", "install", LEAF(), "釋放鎖", 230, 820, 200, 40))')
rep('p4.append(v("l9", "install", ELLIPSE(GREEN), "成功結束", 150, 890, 160, 40))', 'p4.append(v("l9", "install", ELLIPSE(GREEN), "成功結束", 250, 890, 160, 40))')
rep('直接中止。", 30, 950, 400, 50))', '直接中止。", 30, 950, 400, 64))')
rep('p4.append(v("verify", "1", SW(NEUTRAL), "verify（每次 just 前的守門：.<name>/ 跟 image 內的 dist 一致？）", VX2, 60, 460, 720))', 'p4.append(v("verify", "1", SW(NEUTRAL), "verify（每次 just 前的守門）", VX2, 60, 460, 720))')
rep('"比對兩棵樹：image 內 /dist vs .<name>/\\n檔案集合、sha256、執行位（單向：該 +x 的仍 +x）、型別", 130, 320, 200, 60)', '"比對兩棵樹：image 內 /dist vs .<name>/\\n檔案集合、sha256、型別、\\n執行位（單向：該 +x 的仍 +x）", 110, 320, 240, 76)')
rep('p4.append(v("v4", "verify", RHOMBUS, "完全一致？", 140, 420, 180, 80))', 'p4.append(v("v4", "verify", RHOMBUS, "完全一致？", 140, 425, 180, 80))')
rep('<mxPoint x="390" y="460"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>\')\n# diff', '<mxPoint x="390" y="465"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>\')\n# diff')
